<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.5">
<l>māṇik kuṟaḷuru vāya māyaṉai yeṉmaṉat tuḷḷē</l>
<l>pēṇik koṇarntu pukuta vaittukkoṇ ṭēṉpiṟi tiṉṟi</l>
<l>māṇik kappaṇṭā raṅkaṇṭīr valivaṉ kuṟumparka ḷuḷḷīr</l>
<l>pāṇikka vēṇṭā naṭamiṉ paṇṭaṉṟu paṭṭiṉaṅ kāppē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>I took and cherished Māyaṉ as a brahmin dwarf,</l>
<l rend="indent">bringing and placing [him] in my heart,</l>
<l rend="indent">with no other.</l>
<l>You who are mighty and very wicked,</l>
<l rend="indent">look at [my] Ruby Treasure!</l>
<l>Go on! There’s no need to wait!</l>
<l rend="indent">Unlike before, [this] maritime town has protection.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
